// A fixture for chapter 15, not a defect case.
//
// Imports the root file back, by a working-directory path.
//
// ⚠️ A relative path -- 'uses ''../DEF-24-a-cycle-through-the-root''' -- cannot
// be used here, because the root cycle degenerates into runaway path building:
// the search directory accumulates '/../modules' dozens of times before
// failing. A '..' path to a NON-root module resolves correctly, so that is a
// symptom of the cycle rather than a fault in path resolution.

uses 'defects/DEF-24-a-cycle-through-the-root';

function ModName (); begin Exit 'from the module'; end
